# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values for local development.
# .env.local is gitignored — never commit real secrets.
# In CI/production these are supplied as GitHub Actions encrypted repo secrets
# (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions), NOT via this file.
#
# See SETUP.md for how to obtain these values.

